# Data Flow Diagram

System-wide data flow:

## Real-time Data Pipeline
```
1. Physical World
   ↓
2. Sensors (DHT22, LDR)
   ↓
3. ESP32 Reading Module
   ↓
4. Serial Protocol (115200 baud)
   ↓
5. Python Serial Interface
   ↓
6. Sensor Data Router (broadcast)
   ├→ Central Controller
   ├→ RL Agents (Temperature & Humidity)
   └→ Logging System
   ↓
7. Agent Decision Making
   ├→ Temperature Agent (Q-Learning)
   ├→ Humidity Agent (Q-Learning)
   └→ Conflict Resolver
   ↓
8. Action Merger
   ↓
9. ESP32 Control Module
   ↓
10. Relay Drivers
    ↓
11. Actuators (Heater, Cooler, Fan, etc.)
    ↓
12. Physical World
```

## State Management Flow
```
Sensor Readings → Discretization → State Vector
                                     ↓
                              Q-Table Lookup
                                     ↓
                          Action Selection (argmax)
                                     ↓
                         Conflict Resolution Checks
                                     ↓
                            Command Execution
```

## Data Rates
- Sensor reading interval: 5 seconds
- Control loop interval: 10 seconds
- Serial communication: 115200 bps
- Display refresh: 2 seconds

## Storage/Persistence
- Q-tables: PKL files (pickle format)
- Logs: Daily rotating log files
- Training data: CSV export capability
- Configuration: JSON format

Image format: PNG, 1920x1440px - Flow chart style
